137&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tr\\u00e0 v\\u00e0 c\\u00e0 ph\\u00ea danh ti\\u1ebfng:&lt;\\/strong&gt; Tr\\u00e0 shan tuy\\u1ebft c\\u1ed5 th\\u1ee5, c\\u00e0 ph\\u00ea Weasel,... th\\u01a1m ngon, \\u0111\\u1eadm \\u0111\\u00e0, t\\u1ea1o n\\u00ean nh\\u1eefng ph\\u00fat gi\\u00e2y th\\u01b0\\u1edfng th\\u1ee9c \\u0111\\u1eb3ng c\\u1ea5p.&lt;\\/span&gt;&lt;\\/li&gt;\\r\\n\\t&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-9:145&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;H\\u1ea1t dinh d\\u01b0\\u1ee1ng ch\\u1ecdn l\\u1ecdc:&lt;\\/strong&gt; H\\u1ea1t macca \\u00dac, \\u00f3c ch\\u00f3 M\\u1ef9, h\\u1ea1t \\u0111i\\u1ec1u B\\u00ecnh Ph\\u01b0\\u1edbc,... gi\\u00f2n tan, b\\u1ed5 d\\u01b0\\u1ee1ng, t\\u1ed1t cho s\\u1ee9c kh\\u1ecfe v\\u00e0 mang \\u00fd ngh\\u0129a th\\u1ecbnh v\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng.&lt;\\/span&gt;&lt;\\/li&gt;\\r\\n\\t&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;10:1-10:119&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;R\\u01b0\\u1ee3u vang tr\\u1ee9 danh (t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn):&lt;\\/strong&gt; R\\u01b0\\u1ee3u vang Chile, Ph\\u00e1p, \\u00dd,... h\\u01b0\\u01a1ng v\\u1ecb n\\u1ed3ng n\\u00e0n, tinh t\\u1ebf, n\\u00e2ng t\\u1ea7m gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb m\\u00f3n qu\\u00e0.&lt;\\/span&gt;&lt;\\/li&gt;\\r\\n\\t&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-12:0&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;\\u0110\\u1eb7c s\\u1ea3n v\\u00f9ng mi\\u1ec1n (t\\u00f9y ch\\u1ecdn):&lt;\\/strong&gt; L\\u1ea1p x\\u01b0\\u1edfng, kh\\u00f4 b\\u00f2, tr\\u00e1i c\\u00e2y s\\u1ea5y,... th\\u00eam ph\\u1ea7n phong ph\\u00fa v\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u1eb7c s\\u1eafc cho h\\u1ed9p qu\\u00e0.&lt;\\/span&gt;&lt;\\/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;\\/ul&gt;\\r\\n\\r\\n&lt;p data-sourcepos=&quot;13:1-13:25&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-