if&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Trọng lượng: 150 gram&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;HSD: 45 ngày&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 0pt 0pt 8pt; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Bánh Trung Thu Sầu Riêng Dừa Sợi Trứng Muối','',0,0,0,17,'noibat,hienthi','san-pham',1730346808,'2024-10-31 03:53:28','2025-08-08 09:53:35',1753772802,159,'sau-rieng-tm-1753772802.png','2025-07-29 07:06:42'),(375,'37','0','23',NULL,0,'sakura2-1753519557.png',NULL,NULL,'','','banh-trung-thu-sakura','',NULL,'&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Bánh Trung Thu SAKURA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Chiếc bánh trung thu SAKURA là sự kết hợp mới lạ giữa mùi hương hoa anh đào với hạt sen tạo ra một vị bánh độc đáo. Với với lớp vỏ nướng vàng óng, mềm mịn, được làm từ hạt sen 100% và đường tảo Trehalose dành cho người ăn kiêng.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Đặc điểm nổi bật:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Nhân làm từ hoa anh đào thơm dịu ngọt: Sự kết hợp mới lạ của hương hoa Sakura với đường tảo và hạt sen tạo ra hương vị bánh mới, thơm ngon, tốt cho sức khỏe.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Vỏ bánh mềm mịn: Vỏ bánh được làm từ bột mì cao cấp và đường ăn kiêng, tạo nên lớp vỏ mềm mịn, ít ngọt, phù hợp với mọi lứa tuổi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;An toàn vệ sinh thực phẩm: Bánh trung thu được sản xuất trên dây chuyền hiện đại tại nhà máy Sona đạt chuẩn ISO 22000 – 2018, đảm bảo an toàn vệ sinh thực phẩm.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Hạn sử dụng: 45 ngày kể từ ngày sản xuất, giúp bạn thưởng thức bánh trong suốt mùa trung thu.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Thành phần:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&