sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Bánh Trung Thu Choco Đậu Phộng&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Chiếc bánh trung thu với sự kết hợp giữa chocolate nguyên chất và đậu phộng rang bùi béo, mang đến hương vị đậm đà, quyến rũ. Lớp vỏ bánh nướng thơm lừng, nhân mềm mịn và ngọt vừa phải, phù hợp với nhiều độ tuổi, đặc biệt là các tín đồ mê socola.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Đặc điểm nổi bật:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Nhân choco đậu phộng thơm