=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Bánh Trung Thu Dưa Lưới&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Chiếc bánh trung thu Dưa Lưới chắc chắn là hương vị mà bạn chưa từng nghe qua, hương dưa lưới đặc trưng của vùng nhiệt đới, tươi mát giúp chiếc bánh trở nên thú vị hơn. Với lớp vỏ nướng vàng óng thơm bơ, nhân bánh được làm từ đường tảo Trehalose đảm bảo không ngọt gắt và phù hợp cho người ăn kiêng.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Đặc điểm nổi bật:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Nhân làm từ hạt sen táo đỏ: Sự kết hợp truyền thống của hai lọai thực phẩm dinh dưỡng trong văn hóa phương Đông, kết hợp với đường tảo tạo ra vị ngọt dịu, tốt cho sức khỏe.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Vỏ bánh mềm mịn: Vỏ bánh được làm từ bột mì cao cấp và đường ăn kiêng, tạo nên lớp vỏ mềm mịn, ít ngọt không hề ngán.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;An toàn vệ sinh thực phẩm: Bánh trung thu giờ đây được sản xuất trực tiếp trên dây chuyền hiện đại tại nhà máy Sona đạt chuẩn ISO 22000 – 2018, đảm bảo an toàn vệ sinh thực phẩm.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Hạn sử dụng: 45 ngày kể từ ngày sản xuất, giúp bạn thưởng thức bánh trong suốt mùa trung thu.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Thành phần:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:1.38&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Bột mì, đường tảo ăn kiêng, dưa lưới, bí đao,...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n',NULL,'&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#555555&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration:none&quot;&gt;Hướng dẫn sử dụng:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n	&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: disc; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&l